lass=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CLIMB</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is no race. There\u2019s no one else on the track. Just you, your flying car, and a path full of floating platforms, brutal\u00a0obstacles, and gravity defying challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801540/extras/ef5126ad5bdfae8096b2d25a1eb8a050.poster.avif?t=1753446637\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801540/extras/ef5126ad5bdfae8096b2d25a1eb8a050.webm?t=1753446637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801540/extras/ef5126ad5bdfae8096b2d25a1eb8a050.mp4?t=1753446637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One mistake could end it all.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every leap matters. Every landing counts. Slip, and it's a long fall back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801540/extras/86492ecc868b415a26f9f92f3ebd164d.poster.avif?t=1753446637\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801540/extras/86492ecc868b415a26f9f92f3ebd164d.webm?t=1753446637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801540/extras/86492ecc868b415a26f9f92f3ebd164d.mp4?t=1753446637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
